  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.28.1 - Case-aware mapping suppression and AM021 fixer reliability\n\n            Fixes:\n            - Corrected AM021 diagnostics and fixes to keep source and destination property casing separate\n            - Fixed AM021 case-only collection mismatches so generated ForMember fixes target the destination member and source expression correctly\n            - Extended shared mapping configuration helper parsing so string literal member paths resolve to their top-level destination member\n            - Expanded AM006/AM020/AM021 regression coverage for explicit configuration suppression and conflict ownership\n\n            Validation:\n            - 648 tests passing, 9 skipped in Release configuration\n            - Focused AM006/AM020/AM021 helper and code-fix regression suites passing locally\n\n            Previous Release: v2.28.0 - analyzer improvements",
